{"type":"thought","text":"The workbook is built, and every one of the 18 requirements has at least one test case (no uncovered ones reported).\n\n- **Files:** in `output/2026-11-19-c47bf2/`: `leave-management-system-v2_TestCases.xlsx`, the source JSON, and three TestRail CSVs (`_testrail_functional.csv`, `_testrail_api.csv`, `_testrail_roles.csv`).\n- **Counts:** 124 cases: 81 functional, 26 API (FR-5 lists three endpoints) and 17 role-based, plus a permission matrix for Employee, Manager and HR Admin. By type: 26 positive, 39 negative, 27 corner, 32 boundary. By priority: 64 High, 41 Medium, 19 Low. That's 52% High, abov","t":1795076332133}
